      "本地核对：common/traditions/99_README_TRADITIONS.txt、common/tradition_categories/99_README_TRADITION_CATEGORIES.txt、00_diplomacy.txt、00_enmity.txt、00_ascension_perks.txt（Stellaris Lyra v4.1.7）"
